# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository, whatever the checkout OS.
#
# Added 2026-08-03 after a run of doc edits on Windows silently rewrote four
# spec files from LF to CRLF. Nothing broke, but every line of each file showed
# as changed, which buries the two lines that actually changed and makes a diff
# unreviewable. Without this, whether a file flips depends on which machine and
# which tool touched it last.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
